@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/messages/[message_uuid]/actions/star/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceMessageController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "Worker scope=user-message\nlease + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/messages/{message_uuid}/actions/star/invoke
API -> DB: resolve public placement; check active membership + generation
API -> DB: placement STATE.starred=true + immutable outbox event
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable read_counters(outbox_event_uuid,\nproject+user+placement); 没有 coalescing
Worker -> Worker: 一个 fenced owner exact user-message scope
Worker -> Projection: 提交当前用户的消息
Worker -> Events: message.updated 目前的用户\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
note over API,Worker
  Topic lock 没有使用. Retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper 必须.
end note
@enduml
